{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82840857c4e7bd5e2d8b2875186dd67398c7c10de7839bd3c9507bd8a8017403", "ja": "（アイドルの衣装にはこまめな調整が不可欠だ。\n未来の新しい衣装も、そろそろ大丈夫かな……）", "zh": "（偶像的服装是必须时时调整的，\n未来也差不多快换好新服装了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "e76f4181bcdff4e02936abe9dd373c1c61f199c9be51f3138b47dd2a7bc94751", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　今回の衣装、\nバッチリです♪　どうですか？　似合ってますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！这次的服装非常完美♪\n看起来怎么样？适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "37e166cb9841cb3a52a31cc4e9448cbcc56d9f74e5d0a150f03f27c764b9e8a1", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってると思う。\n今回の衣装、名前もデザインも未来にピッタリだな！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得很适合。\n这次的服装，名称和设计都和未来是绝配呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e6c1970b70e3c4bd1cc9ace96dd51cda28dfddf0f452beebfe823c8efc45468", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございまーす！\n私も、すっごく気に入ってるんです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你～！\n我自己也非常喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "04761e04a9be13d22dca27eb59ede5c3602aad266e7f4f8e0c9bfeb9d25ec089", "ja": "かわいいだけじゃなくて、『近未来風』って\nコンセプトも、私にぴったりですよね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "除了可爱以外，这种『近未来风』的概念，\n也正好符合我的形象呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "13a8c52ef5297921f3cb7500fbec58ebbe3636157e51408c18797b55debb970f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nひとつ、聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我可以问个问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "52f5f251e13aa52c8d29bb1a91af6dd8d45c625a941fb914e2ee9d263b1360e0", "ja": "いいけど、なんだ？", "zh": "好啊，你要问什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "1a4ef07d82ac2a436bd2aab499ad4817cd55247ab27bf1b064262ef5c61fd0ed", "ja": "はい！　この衣装って『近未来風』なんですよね？\n『近未来』って、何年くらい先のことなんですか？", "zh": "就是！这套服装是『近未来风』对吧？\n那『近未来』指的是几年之后啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "99fb7d79cd056623c761e1432cbf2a2a27428219cb756894211b2bfe01b6f139", "ja": "えーっと、そうだな……近い未来だから、\n10年か20年くらい先のことだと思うけど……。", "zh": "我想想，这个嘛……因为是不远的未来，\n所以指的应该是十年或二十年之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "4d7c2bb5f5cb69853f5f79cbe4b10ed81cd6a401421262cfea8fb84140b9e545", "ja": "ええっ！？　じゃあ、私が24歳くらいになったら、\nみんなこんな服を着てるんですか！？", "zh": "咦咦！？那等到我24岁时，\n大家都会穿这种衣服吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "736794bc7c0c74a31d6f9c6da09bb1bd12ea33c37fa25463be273e4da7c8528e", "ja": "いや、それはないか……。多分、この場合で言う\n『近未来』は、本当の未来のことじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不，我想是不会……这边讲的『近未来』，\n多半不是指真正的未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0c17a56185a5c628d04d9088193e6e067466a7d48c37685f4712487b96d94790", "ja": "こうだったらいいなっていう、\n理想の未来のことを言うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "而是希望今后会变成这样，\n算是一种理想中的未来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "48242d5f97a822963c089aa90e56274daa9a695cf896dd11b5a9d47221252872", "ja": "『近未来』は理想の未来、ですか……？", "zh": "『近未来』是理想中的未来，是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a084d006b285ad011e99b550c24607016f91551f028fa9845fae5a08363a064e", "ja": "ああ。たとえば、未来は10年後、\nどんな未来になってて欲しいと思う？", "zh": "是啊。比方说，未来希望十年后，\n自己会是什么样子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "37c450558e4b2a00c30eadc1dd1bfc80fc7c22cfaf026d1816369ee4cda7743c", "ja": "10年後ですか？　それはもちろん……えへへ。", "zh": "十年后吗？那当然是……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb69c2abfeb69c300b693b3e9a2ee65e1632c466ae6cfa64b253bf3fb0d9128f", "ja": "10年後も20年後も、ずっと、ずーっと\n{$P$}さんとアイドルしてたいです！", "zh": "不管是十年后还是二十年后，我都想\n和{$P$}先生一直一～直当偶像下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "a44f966bdb13529f6204a0feb4fe07fbacdbae13fa29f5704707e49d8f256166", "ja": "{$P$}さんはどうですか？\n10年後は、何をしてたいですか？", "zh": "那{$P$}先生呢？\n你希望自己十年后在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b69c599ac1f659db4a9e5cb054edaf07527b16515e05eea2a12c118678174e62", "ja": "もちろん、俺もずっと、\n未来のプロデュースを続けるつもりだ！", "zh": "这还用问，\n我当然也要一直当未来的制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "75d28331c39c3113c98ceca296cca73f0a4b55f12ffc38366dc8cd9dfb8dab39", "ja": "ほんとですか！？　でへへ……。\n早く『近未来』が来るといいですね！", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……\n希望『近未来』可以早点到来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "27e4a3bce28e66df04c5e5c2fccc5ba3168f72ffc56f248c945e44b727505a89", "ja": "あ！　でも待ってください、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊！不过等一下，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "5fda36a4bb71277ca6d7148ac6b41c20d340c0403f7f4c21a354fc2bb94e44c3", "ja": "私、今{$P$}さんと一緒に、\nアイドルやってますよね？　それって……。", "zh": "我现在已经和{$P$}先生\n一起在从事偶像事业了对吧？那这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "0055e3bfa6de433e36c92f48295e4409d433ca100b47370850e1d2426557e92b", "ja": "もしかして『近未来』って、今なんじゃないですか！？", "zh": "所谓的『近未来』，讲的会不会就是现在！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_1023", "source_sha256": "1c990aafbacc874ab25cfdf15b13d2e376090b42bc27c621287530669e3bed7a", "ja": "そうかもしれない！", "zh": "或许是呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cfddb8f7a14a9784f133511634e4ff8f0866b23d3119af474c0e32c69e9c6cff", "ja": "確かに、そういう考えもあるかもしれない。\n未来はすごいことに気がつくな……。", "zh": "的确，这种看法或许也没错。\n未来发现了一个惊人的事实呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "d94f808fd83533daaa7fe82cae7aabfb2c279d3bd5938d192526813d896feaa4", "ja": "わぁ、やっぱりそうなんですね！？\nすごいかも♪", "zh": "哇！果然是这样吗！？\n我好像很厉害♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_2002_014mir", "source_sha256": "b3558f6ffa225bfe6869eb59c7eb42328e235bb74e703a5e54cb1584b1e53bdc", "ja": "あれ？　でも、今が『近未来』なら、10年後は……。\nあ、あれ？　あれれ……？", "zh": "咦？可是，现在算『近未来』的话，那十年后……\n奇、奇怪？奇怪奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0114_2003_p", "source_sha256": "54892d26f9847c14671e1efdd08aa22e80a168469938f10d6abb22eeb67abdd9", "ja": "（混乱しているみたいだが……未来にとって、夢を\n叶えつつある今こそ『理想の未来』かもしれないな！）", "zh": "（未来好像陷入混乱了……对她来说，正在实现\n梦想的现今，或许就是『理想中的未来』呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
